#. ID 43, Page 1, Line 10, Pos (2,8)
#. ID 43, Page 2, Line 10, Pos (2,8)
#. ID 43, Page 3, Line 10, Pos (2,8)
#. ID 43, Page 4, Line 10, Pos (2,8)
