msgstr "那么…开始上课。"

#. ID 43, Page 1, Line 11, Pos (2,8)
#. ID 43, Page 2, Line 11, Pos (2,8)
#. ID 43, Page 3, Line 11, Pos (2,8)
#. ID 43, Page 4, Line 11, Pos (2,8)
