"君たちの義務だ。"
msgstr "成为像莉莉姆那样淫乱的奴隶也是你们的义务。"

#. ID 43, Page 1, Line 271, Pos (2,8)
#. ID 43, Page 2, Line 271, Pos (2,8)
#. ID 43, Page 3, Line 304, Pos (2,8)
#. ID 43, Page 4, Line 260, Pos (2,8)
msgid ""
