msgstr "哎呀？"

#. ID 58, Page 2, Line 95, Pos (5,8)
#. Contains choice at line 2 (2 options)
msgid "君も彼女と同じ用件か？"
msgstr "你也是和她一样的事吗？"

#. ID 58, Page 2, Line 96, Pos (5,8)
#. Choice (2 options, embedded in a message)
msgid ""
